      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-26T07:57:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mine was a longer slog.&nbsp; The Environment, Akash'Bhuta and poor choices conspired against me to the point that I lost everyone but The Scholar in the same Villain turn while Akash'Bhuta was still just under 100HP.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The incapacitated heroes were able to help out tremendously, though.&nbsp; The Scholar went into tortoise mode, and slow and steady won the race.</p>",
