      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-26T09:54:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint here, though this game really reminded me of how much I loathe Atlantis. Damn you to hell leaky room!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Absolute Zero and Tempest ate an unusual amount of hate and both went down (though at least that meant Atlantis was no longer a factor at all), but Ra and Scholar pulled through, both in double-digits and burned the house down for the win.</p>",
