      "id": 179322,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-26T12:54:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Akash'Bhuta is probably my favorite villain to fight, so I was very pleased to see this one. :D Minted, though it was getting hairy as heroes dropped one by one. Of course, if there's one thing the Scholar (why was he Ma-Ti?) is good at, it's ah-ah-ah-ah stayin' alive! Granted, things looked bleak once the brambles got him, but suffice to say, EWAZ is on my short list of anti-Akash fighters from now on. That one cold damage a round actually made a big difference! All it took was believing in the heart of the (environment) cards; the Kraken finished her off for me!</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:03:40.676Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
