      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/ea5d25/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-26T13:38:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Minted. AZ and Tempest died when AB was way over 100. Scholar tanked getting tons of cards while Ra couldn't do damage for 5 turns (being at 7 HP). Incap AZ blocked the environment and incap Tempest prevented most of the damage (ocasionally giving some power uses to Scholar to do some damage and get extra cards). Ra had 20 cards in hand at the end of the game.</p>",
