      "id": 179326,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-27T03:29:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;AZ and Tempest dropped, locking down the environment and three (three!) Entombs respectively. &nbsp;Normally, I dread dealing with Entomb, but in this case they worked out in my favor - between the three of them and a rather useless Allies of the Earth, all my enemies were Drawn to the Flame, and Ra made them toasty indeed. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Did anybody else get 2 Leaking Rooms in a row, or was I just unlucky? &nbsp;I hit a third one later, too!</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
