      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-27T08:30:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mint. &nbsp;AZ and Tempest dropped, locking down the environment and three (three!) Entombs respectively. &nbsp;Normally, I dread dealing with Entomb, but in this case they worked out in my favor - between the three of them and a rather useless Allies of the Earth, all my enemies were Drawn to the Flame, and Ra made them toasty indeed. &nbsp;&nbsp;Did anybody else get 2 Leaking Rooms in a row, or was I just unlucky? &nbsp;I hit a third one later, too!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I got them too (all 3 of them). When those back-to-back Leaky Rooms hit I nearly threw my computer out the window!</p>",
