      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-27T14:34:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got Mint, and almost kept everyone alive, one of those \"If the Kraken doesn't come out right now we will win with no incaps\" turns, and of course, Kraken.</p><p>Stratosphering Entomb twice was huge, as was dodging Pillars of Hercules the second time. &nbsp;Last round of the Game Scholar was at 21hp, AZ and Ra were in double digits. &nbsp;I used a lot of health finishing the game (Ra dealing himself 5 and then 4 retaliation damage to use a power via Proverbs and Axioms dropped him to 2hp but sealed the win) but scored the Mint, only got 1 incap ability from Tempest.</p>",
