      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/hstein3/{size}/2159_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-29T20:03:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No Mint for me. This was brutal. The Pillars of Hercules came out early, and it resulted in a lot of Ongoing/Equipment destruction by AB.</p><p>The game truly ended, though, when I got&nbsp;<em>four</em> Entombs in a row; two at once, they went off, the deck was shuffled, and then two more came out on the same turn&nbsp;<em>again</em>.&nbsp;</p><p>I might have managed if Tempest's or AZ's ongoing destruction weren't buried in their decks, but there it was.&nbsp;</p>",
