      "created_at": "2016-07-30T15:20:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Similar story to others--Scholar only hero left, and after a long slog the environment took out Akash' Bhuta. Scholar had 10 HP left.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was kicking myself because in the first round I played a Lightning Slash....forgetting that Tempest was Ensnared by Brambles and couldn't deal damage. &nbsp;Oops! I almost hit the rewind button, but braved on and it worked out.</p>",
